research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u2-one-instanton-fixed-points.md-58-
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u2-one-instanton-fixed-points.md-59-[F1] [[def-framed-u-n-instanton-moduli-and-adhm-data]]: the positive-FI complex quotient is formed from the stable solutions of $[B_1,B_2]+IJ=0$ by $GL(V)$, with $\mathbf W=e_1^{-1}+e_2^{-1}$.
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u2-one-instanton-fixed-points.md-60-
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u2-one-instanton-fixed-points.md:61:[F2] [[thm-adhm-fixed-point-instanton-count]]: fixed points are indexed by two-tuples of partitions of total size one, and the tangent character is $\mathbf V^\vee\mathbf V(t_1+t_2-1-t_1t_2)+\mathbf V^\vee\mathbf W^\vee+t_1t_2\mathbf W\mathbf V$.
