research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u1-one-box-fixed-point.md-39-
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u1-one-box-fixed-point.md-40-[F1] [[def-framed-u-n-instanton-moduli-and-adhm-data]]: for $V=W=\mathbb C$, stability is equivalent to $I\neq0$ and the complex moment map is $IJ=0$.
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u1-one-box-fixed-point.md-41-
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/borel-index-reconciliation/before/items/ex-adhm-u1-one-box-fixed-point.md:42:[F2] [[thm-adhm-fixed-point-instanton-count]]: the fixed points for $N=1,k=1$ are indexed by the one one-box partition, and their tangent character is computed from the ADHM deformation complex.
