1.1 By [A2] and [F2], the $T$-fixed points of $X_{k,N}^\zeta$ are isolated and correspond bijectively to $N$-tuples $\vec Y$ with $|\vec Y|=k$. At each such point the tangent representation has the displayed character, so its equivariant Euler class is the product $E_{\vec Y}$ of the corresponding additive weights. [given, A2, F2]

