## Facts & Assumptions

**Given:** "'$N'"\\geq2"'$, $k'"\\geq0"'$, $'"\\zeta>0"'$, the positive-FI stable ADHM quotient, its compact rotation/framing torus action, and the localized mass-inserted Borel–Moore pushforward stipulated in the Statement.

[F1] [[def-qftx-instanton-equivariant-partition-series]]: the coefficient is the localized proper-fixed-locus pushforward of $c_{2kN}''^{T_m}(TX'"\\otimes L_{-1})\\cap[X]"'$, has field $'"\\mathbb Q(\\epsilon_1,\\epsilon_2,a_1,\\ldots,a_N,\\widetilde m)"'$, and the series is coefficientwise formal.

[F2] [[thm-adhm-fixed-point-instanton-count]]: for the positive-FI stable quotient, the current Statement gives smooth complex dimension $2kN$, isolated fixed points bijective with $N$-tuples of partitions of total size $k$, and the tangent character displayed in the Statement. Its proof retains separate conditional Gieseker/ASD correspondence clauses and does not supply the noncompact Borel–Moore pushforward used here; the current Step 1 decision is escalated for its upstream readiness chain.

